PMID 35131037 YEAR 2022 NCT NCT03811574 DOI 10.1016/S2213-8587(22)00008-0 PUBTYPES ['Clinical Trial, Phase III', 'Journal Article', 'Randomized Controlled Trial', "Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't", 'Equivalence Trial']
