- METHODS: We conducted a single-blind, placebo-controlled trial in 20 obese women with polycystic ovary syndrome (PCOS; mean [range] age 35 [32.3-40.8] years, body mass index 37 [30.7-39.8] kg/m2 ) randomized to subcutaneous semaglutide 1.0 mg once weekly or placebo for 12 weeks.
